{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50151","headline":"秋夜巫山 · 乔备","name":"秋夜巫山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巫峡徘徊雨，阳台潭[一]荡云。\n江山空窈窕，朝暮自氛氲。\n萤色寒秋露，猿啼清夜闻。\n唯怜梦魂远，肠断思纷纷。\n（[一]俞云：「『潭』当作『澹』。\n」刘云：「潭荡双声字。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔备","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}